---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ScheduleGrid from "../../components/ScheduleGrid.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" page="schedule_overview" title="Schedule Overview – Studio Sun & Sea">
  <h1>Weekly Rhythm</h1>
  <p>
    Here’s a quick look at our weekly rhythm at Studio Sun & Sea. This overview shows the weekly structure at a glance; booking happens through the <a href="/en/schedule/">full schedule</a>.
    Learn more about the <a href="/en/classes/">Classes</a>.
  </p>

  <ScheduleGrid lang="en" />

  <p>
    For booking and the most up-to-date availability, visit the
    <a href="/en/schedule/">full schedule</a>.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Class Types</h2>

    <h3><a href="/en/schedule/#foundational">Kunga Yoga Flow</a></h3>
    <p>
      Breath-led, calm, and focused movement. Accessible yet challenging, alignment-based practice that meets you where you are.
      Full description on the <a href="/en/classes/#foundational">Classes</a> page.
    </p>

    <h3><a href="/en/schedule/#26+2">26+2 (Non-Heated)</a></h3>
    <p>
      A steady, meditative sequence of 26 postures and 2 breathing exercises, taught without added heat. Offered in 60-minute (Express) and 90-minute (Classic) formats.
      Full description on the <a href="/en/classes/#26+2">Classes</a> page.
    </p>

    <h3>Help Shape the Schedule</h3>
    <p>
      We value your input! Help us create the perfect weekly schedule by sharing your preferences and availability. If you’d like to see <a href="/en/contact/?interest=yin">Yin</a>, <a href="/en/contact/?interest=barre">Barre</a>, or <a href="/en/contact/?interest=meditation">Meditation</a> added, let us know.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p>
    <a href="/images/classes/studio-sun-and-sea-weekly-schedule.png" download>Download Weekly Schedule (PNG 1080×680)</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
